        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Subtitle Text from a Recording\n\nTranscribes a recording and breaks the transcript into subtitle-length captions. The line-length rule is what turns a transcript into usable subtitles.\n\n**How it works:** \"Recording\" takes a video. \"Extract audio\" pulls out the soundtrack, and \"Transcribe\" converts it to English text. \"Agent\" splits the text into numbered captions of at most two 42-character lines, and \"Output\" returns them.\n\n**Try this:** Pick models on \"Transcribe\" and \"Agent\", then set the language on \"Transcribe\" to match a recording that is not in English."
        },
